            "review_title": "Review at Green Pepper Beer Corner",
            "review_text": "Samuel S\n2 contributions\n0\nDrink beer in Hanoi\nJul 2023 • Friends\nWe have been walking around this area for quite a while, so we decided to visit this restaurant. I see that there are also some other restaurants next door but we still come here, maybe we want to experience the feeling of drinking beer on the sidewalk. It's quite a new feeling for us when trying to eat like a Vietnamese, it's really hard to describe. The food here is also good but the service is a bit slow.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 29, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
