            "review_title": "Review at Green Pepper Beer Corner",
            "review_text": "Harry H\n2 contributions\n0\nGreen Pepper Beer Corner Restaurant\nJun 2023 • Friends\nMy friend and I went to have a few beers at this restaurant, we appreciate the service attitude of the staff as well as the cleanliness of the restaurant, the tables and chairs are arranged neatly. The restaurant's food was also quite good, so we ordered beer to drink together, a bit disappointed because the bar's beer has a bit of a bitter taste, I think it's not my taste because my friend also said that the beer here is not so delicious\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 28, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
