            "review_title": "Review at Green Pepper Beer Corner",
            "review_text": "Diveguide\nNewcastle upon Tyne, United Kingdom225 contributions\n0\nThe one thing you must do\nMar 2017 • Couples\nIn Hanoi you must go to beer corner, sit outside on a tiny stool and see Hanoi go past as you sit on a tiny stool with a glass of the cheapest beer you can buy anywhere in the world\nThe police will turn up at 8pm and they take all the stools away then put them back as soon as the police go\nScooters weave in and out of the pedestrians and cars, people selling food, people selling hundreds of helium balloons it look like the cartoon UP, 20 cyclos going past with a tour group in them and the other customers sitting round you are like the united nations\nThe street next to beer corner is also full of bars and restaurants but this is the place to go some of the bars/restaurants along the streets of the crossroads will only let you sit outside if you are eating\nDO NOT MISS THIS EXPERIENCE\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 15, 2017",
            "rating": 4.0,
